<h3 id="4-cluster-activity-log-calog"><strong>4. Cluster Activity Log (CALOG)</strong></h3>
<p>CALOG is the “event log” for Grid Infrastructure, stored in MGMTDB. Use it to investigate failures:</p>

<div class="language-bash highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="c"># Query events after a specific time</span>
crsctl query calog <span class="nt">-aftertime</span> <span class="s2">"2026-03-07 08:00:00"</span>

<span class="c"># Filter by resource (e.g., a database)</span>
crsctl query calog <span class="nt">-entity</span> ora.prod_db.db

<span class="c"># Check retention (default: 72 hours)</span>
crsctl get calog retentiontime
</code></pre></div></div>

